NOT MEDICAL ADVICE, AND NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE

This software displays glucose readings it did not measure, obtained through an
interface it does not control. It can be late, wrong, or silent without warning,
and its alarms can fail to arrive for reasons outside its control.

Nothing it shows is medical advice. Do not use it to decide a dose, to treat a
low, or in place of the equipment and guidance your clinician gave you. The
manufacturer's own app and a fingerstick are the sources that count.

It has not been assessed or approved by any regulator, and it carries no
warranty of any kind.

